**[Maintainance of this dissector moved to MaximDzhezhelo/hornetq-wireshark-dissector](https://github.com/MaximDzhezhelo/hornetq-wireshark-dissector/tree/extended) (as of commit on extended branch).**

Experimental HornetQ dissector written using Wireshark's Lua dissector support.

This is ongoing work, not all messages might be listed or decoded correctly. Usually a ! mark will show that the decoding of that particular message is incomplete.

All contributions are welcome!
